{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:0.2", "PA_ja_243:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs, Chapter on the Jackal (Siṅgālavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:0.4"], "en": "3. The Guttila Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:1.1", "PA_ja_243:1.2"], "en": "“I played the lute, which had seven strings and was most sweet and delightful.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:1.3"], "en": "Thus he calls out to me from the arena:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:1.4"], "en": "\"Kosiya, be my refuge!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:2.1"], "en": "\"I am your refuge, my friend,\" [he replied].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:2.2", "PA_ja_243:2.3"], "en": "“I am one who honors my teacher; that disciple shall not defeat you, O teacher, but you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:2.4"], "en": "teacher, shall defeat that disciple.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_243:3.1"], "en": "The Guttila Jātaka, the third.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
